T*
(   - Step 4 \(C-Strand Fill-In\): Once the G-rich strand has been substantially extended,) Tj
T*
(   conventional Pol alpha-primase and Pol delta synthesize the complementary C-rich strand,) Tj
T*
(   followed by FEN1 processing and ligation.) Tj
T*
(   4. Cancer and Cellular Immortality:) Tj
T*
(   Normal human somatic cells repress TERT expression; telomeres progressively shorten, triggering) Tj
T*
(   the Hayflick limit and senescence. In contrast, > 90% of human malignancies upregulate TERT) Tj
T*
(   expression, acquiring unlimited replicative immortality.) Tj
