(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the molecular mechanism of Transcription-Coupled Repair \(TC-NER\) and explain how Cockayne Syndrome proteins CSA and CSB operate.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Transcription-Coupled Nucleotide Excision Repair \(TC-NER\) Mechanics:) Tj
T*
(   1. Dedicated Strand-Specific Repair:) Tj
T*
(   While Global Genome NER repairs lesions randomly across the genome, Transcription-Coupled NER) Tj
T*
(   specifically targets transcription-blocking DNA lesions located on the transcribed \(template\)) Tj
T*
(   strand of actively expressed genes, ensuring uninterrupted synthesis of essential mRNAs.) Tj
T*
(   2. The Lesion Sensor: Stalled RNA Polymerase II:) Tj
T*
