(   [Problem Statement]: Discuss the molecular regulation of Transcription Pausing and Elongation by DSIF, NELF, and P-TEFb.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Promoter-Proximal Pausing and the P-TEFb Elongation Switch:) Tj
T*
(   1. Promoter-Proximal Pausing Phenomenon:) Tj
T*
(   In metazoan cells, RNA Polymerase II does not transcribe continuously into the gene body after) Tj
T*
(   initiation; instead, on thousands of developmental and signal-responsive genes, Pol II pauses) Tj
T*
(   stably 20 to 60 nucleotides downstream of the transcription start site.) Tj
T*
(   2. Assembly of the Pausing Complex \(DSIF and NELF\):) Tj
T*
