(   - As the nascent transcript reaches ~20-30 nucleotides and receives its 5'-cap, two negative) Tj
T*
(   elongation factor complexes bind Pol II:) Tj
T*
(   * DSIF \(DRB Sensitivity-Inducing Factor\): A heterodimer of Spt4 and Spt5.) Tj
T*
(   * NELF \(Negative Elongation Factor\): A four-subunit complex \(NELF-A, B, C/D, E\).) Tj
T*
(   - NELF-E binds the nascent RNA, while DSIF binds across the DNA-binding cleft of Pol II,) Tj
T*
(   mechanically locking the catalytic jaw and preventing forward translocation, freezing Pol II in) Tj
T*
