T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The Clinical Spectrum of Nucleotide Excision Repair Disorders:) Tj
T*
(   1. Xeroderma Pigmentosum \(XP - The Cancer-Prone Syndrome\):) Tj
T*
(   - Genetic Etiology: Caused by loss-of-function mutations in seven complementation group genes) Tj
T*
(   involved in Global Genome NER \(XPA through XPG\) or the translesion polymerase POLH \(XP-V\).) Tj
T*
(   - Molecular Pathogenesis: Complete inability to excise UV-induced cyclobutane pyrimidine dimers) Tj
