(   Higher %GC linearly elevates Tm \(Marmur-Doty equation: Tm = 69.3 + 0.41 * [%GC]\).) Tj
T*
(   - Monovalent Cation Concentration \(Ionic Strength, [Na+]\): The phosphate backbone carries a) Tj
T*
(   dense negative charge \(-1 per nucleotide\). In pure water, mutual electrostatic repulsion) Tj
T*
(   between opposing strands destabilizes the duplex. Increasing salt concentration shields) Tj
T*
(   negative charges, dramatically stabilizing the duplex and raising Tm \(Delta Tm proportional to) Tj
