(   - Effector Recruitment: Acetylated lysines serve as specific docking platforms recognized by) Tj
T*
(   Bromodomain-containing proteins, including SWI/SNF chromatin remodelers and TFIID, driving) Tj
T*
(   active transcription.) Tj
T*
(   3. Histone Methylation \(Context-Dependent Signaling\):) Tj
T*
(   - Catalyzed by Histone Methyltransferases \(HMTs\); reversed by Histone Demethylases \(KDMs\).) Tj
T*
(   - Unlike acetylation, methylation does NOT alter the electrical charge of the lysine residue!) Tj
T*
(   Instead, it adds 1, 2, or 3 methyl groups \(mono-, di-, trimethylation\), altering steric bulk) Tj
T*
(   and hydrophobicity.) Tj
T*
(   - Context-Dependent Transcriptional Meaning:) Tj
T*
(   * H3K4me3: Localized at active gene promoters; recognized by Chromodomain and PHD-finger) Tj
T*
(   proteins that recruit the transcription initiation machinery.) Tj
T*
(   * H3K9me3: Found in constitutive heterochromatin; recruits Heterochromatin Protein 1 \(HP1\) to) Tj
T*
(   enforce permanent gene silencing.) Tj
T*
(   * H3K27me3: Polycomb-mediated facultative heterochromatin mark; recruits Polycomb Repressive) Tj
T*
(   Complex 1 \(PRC1\) to silence developmental loci.) Tj
